      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Buy Men's T-Shirts Online – Premium Cotton T-Shirts for Everyday Comfort",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00002",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[2]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 74,
      "endIndex": 469,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "A great men's T-shirt isn't just another item in your closet. It's the absolute backbone of a modern wardrobe. Think about it. Whether you're rushing to a smart-casual office meeting, throwing stuff in a bag for a quick weekend trip, or just lounging on the couch, you need a tee that works. The right T-shirt strikes that perfect, effortless balance between genuine comfort and timeless style.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00003",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[3]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 469,
      "endIndex": 936,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "At Cottonworld, we believe luxury doesn't have to be complicated. It's found in simple, everyday comfort. Our men's cotton T-shirts are designed with serious care, using some of the best natural fabrics around—like 100% Organic Cotton, cutting-edge Cotton Bamboo blends, and flexible Cotton Elastane. We chose these materials for one main reason: they feel amazing against your skin. They naturally regulate your body heat and just keep you comfortable all day long.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00004",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 936,
      "endIndex": 1284,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Every single T-shirt we make gets obsessive attention to detail. We're talking reinforced stitching and collars that actually hold their shape after a few washes. No fading, no sagging. From classic crew necks to those versatile polos you need for Friday nights, our collection of casual T-shirts for men effortlessly upgrades your daily rotation.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00005",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[5]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1284,
      "endIndex": 1325,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Explore Our Collection of Men's T-Shirts",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00006",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[6]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1325,
      "endIndex": 1530,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Finding a fit that looks great without making you feel trapped? That's essential. Whether you lean toward basic staples or elevated casualwear, we've got silhouettes made for every body type and occasion.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00007",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[7]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1530,
      "endIndex": 1853,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.vxb6702u8vty",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Regular Fit T-Shirts: These are built for real life. Our regular fit gives you a classic, easy silhouette. They drape exactly how they should—not too tight, but definitely not baggy. These are the daily drivers that look incredible with your favorite Men's Pants, tailored chinos, or a pair of casual weekend[https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts)[Men's Shorts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts).",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00008",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[8]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1853,
      "endIndex": 2030,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.vxb6702u8vty",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Slim Fit T-Shirts: Need something a bit sharper? Our slim fit lightly hugs the chest and arms. It highlights your build but still gives you the stretch you need to move freely.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00009",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[9]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2030,
      "endIndex": 2360,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.vxb6702u8vty",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Organic Cotton T-Shirts: Woven from 100% responsibly sourced organic cotton, these tees are ridiculously soft and breathable. Because they are grown without harsh pesticides, they're kind to the environment and super gentle on sensitive skin. Go check out our full[https://cottonworld.net/collections/all-mens-clothing](https://cottonworld.net/collections/all-mens-clothing)[Organic Cotton Collection](https://cottonworld.net/collections/all-mens-clothing) if sustainable choices are your thing.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00010",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[10]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2360,
      "endIndex": 2633,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.vxb6702u8vty",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Cotton Bamboo T-Shirts: This is next-level comfort. Bamboo fibre is naturally softer than regular cotton and absorbs moisture like a pro. These men's half sleeve T-shirts basically act like built-in AC for your skin, keeping you incredibly fresh when the weather gets hot.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00011",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[11]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2633,
      "endIndex": 2930,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.vxb6702u8vty",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Polo T-Shirts for Men: Sometimes a regular crew neck feels a little too laid-back. That's when a polo steps in. With crisp collars and clean plackets, they combine sporty heritage with lightweight comfort. Perfect for office casuals or weekend dinners. Dive into our[https://cottonworld.net/search?q=polo&_pos=1&_psq=polo&_psid=357183930&_ss=e](https://cottonworld.net/search?q=polo&_pos=1&_psq=polo&_psid=357183930&_ss=e)[Men's Polos](https://cottonworld.net/search?q=polo&_pos=1&_psq=polo&_psid=357183930&_ss=e) to see the range.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00012",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[12]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2930,
      "endIndex": 2965,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Why Premium Natural Fabrics Matter",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00013",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[13]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2965,
      "endIndex": 3098,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "We don't mess around with the fabrics that sit against your skin. Natural comfort is everything. Here's why our materials stand out.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00014",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[14]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3098,
      "endIndex": 3349,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. 100% Organic Cotton Standard cotton is fine. But organic cotton? It's a game changer. It skips the synthetic fertilizers, uses way less water, and gives you a fabric that breathes naturally. You'll never feel stuffy or trapped in your own clothes.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00015",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[15]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3349,
      "endIndex": 3622,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. The Cotton-Bamboo Blend Bamboo is honestly a miracle fiber. Blended with pure cotton, it feels silky and luxurious. Plus, it pulls sweat away from your body and resists odors naturally. If you live in a humid climate, our Cotton Bamboo T-shirts are basically mandatory.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00016",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[16]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3622,
      "endIndex": 3841,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Cotton Elastane For our active styles, we add a hint of premium elastane to the pure cotton. It gives the fabric a resilient stretch that moves when you move. Best part? The collar won't start sagging after a month.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00017",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[17]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3841,
      "endIndex": 3878,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Shop Men's Cotton T-Shirts by Colour",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00018",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[18]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3878,
      "endIndex": 3981,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "A solid wardrobe needs the right colors. Our tees are garment-dyed so those rich shades actually last.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00019",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[19]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3981,
      "endIndex": 4163,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.8qtx3amwsh6q",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The Essentials: White, Black, Grey, Beige, and Natural Cotton. You cannot negotiate on these. A crisp white tee or a sharp black polo is the very foundation of getting dressed well.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00020",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[20]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4163,
      "endIndex": 4289,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.8qtx3amwsh6q",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Cool Tones: Blue, Navy Blue, and Teal. Navy looks good on literally everyone and goes flawlessly with casual cotton trousers.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00021",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4289,
      "endIndex": 4416,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.8qtx3amwsh6q",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Earth Tones: Olive Green, Khaki, and Rust. These add a slightly rugged vibe and look awesome paired with neutral[https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts)[Men's Shorts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts).",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00022",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[22]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4416,
      "endIndex": 4443,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The Ultimate Styling Guide",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00023",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4443,
      "endIndex": 4525,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "A great T-shirt is a blank canvas. Here's how to wear them out in the real world.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00024",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[24]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4525,
      "endIndex": 4727,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The Everyday Uniform Keep it foolproof. Throw on a crisp white round-neck tee, classic[https://cottonworld.net/search?q=chinos](https://cottonworld.net/search?q=chinos)[Men's Chinos](https://cottonworld.net/search?q=chinos), and fresh sneakers. It works for grabbing coffee, running errands, or just killing time on a Sunday.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00025",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[25]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4727,
      "endIndex": 4943,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Office Ready Yes, you can wear a tee to work. Grab a dark polo—navy or black—and tuck it into tailored Men's Pants. Throw on a decent leather belt and loafers. You look professional, but you're actually comfortable.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00026",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[26]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4943,
      "endIndex": 5164,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Refined Evenings Got a dinner date? Wear a slim-fit black bamboo T-shirt with some dark structured trousers. The secret here is the fit. Make sure the sleeves hug your arms a bit, and the hem drops right below your belt.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00027",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[27]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5164,
      "endIndex": 5392,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Mastering the Layers T-shirts are built for layering. Put a grey tee under a textured overshirt, an open[https://cottonworld.net/search?q=linen+shirt](https://cottonworld.net/search?q=linen+shirt)[Men's Linen Shirt](https://cottonworld.net/search?q=linen+shirt), or a lightweight casual jacket. It adds instant style and handles weird transitional weather perfectly.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00028",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[28]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5392,
      "endIndex": 5432,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Finding the Right Fabric for the Season",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00029",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[29]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5432,
      "endIndex": 5474,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Your clothes should adapt to the weather.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00030",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[30]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5474,
      "endIndex": 5603,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.29t2mc4i7g7r",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Summer Heat: Breathability is everything. Grab our lightweight Organic Cotton or Cotton Bamboo T-shirts to keep the air flowing.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00031",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[31]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5603,
      "endIndex": 5737,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.29t2mc4i7g7r",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The Humid Monsoon: Stickiness demands quick-drying fabrics. Bamboo blends are your best friend here, keeping you fresh and odor-free.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00032",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[32]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5737,
      "endIndex": 5882,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.29t2mc4i7g7r",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Winter Layering: Regular-fit tees make the ultimate base layer. Throw them under heavy sweatshirts or hoodies—they won't bunch up or feel bulky.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00033",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[33]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5882,
      "endIndex": 5920,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "How to Make Your Cotton T-Shirts Last",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00034",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[34]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5920,
      "endIndex": 5983,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Take care of your premium tees and they'll look new for years.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00035",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[35]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5983,
      "endIndex": 6074,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tydkz0smnf61",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Wash Cold: Always use cold water. Heat destroys natural fibers and causes weird shrinkage.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00036",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[36]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6074,
      "endIndex": 6145,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tydkz0smnf61",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Inside Out: Turn them inside out before washing to protect the colors.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00037",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[37]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6145,
      "endIndex": 6232,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tydkz0smnf61",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Mild Detergent: Skip the harsh chemicals. Gentle detergents keep organic cotton happy.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00038",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[38]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6232,
      "endIndex": 6313,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
