      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00051",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[51]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6677,
      "endIndex": 6907,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Which fabric is actually best for men's T-shirts? \u000bNatural fabrics all the way. 100% Organic Cotton and Cotton Bamboo are unbeatable. Unlike stuffy polyester, they breathe, feel incredible on the skin, and handle sweat easily.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00052",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[52]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6907,
      "endIndex": 7153,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Can Cottonworld T-shirts survive a hot Indian summer? \u000bDefinitely. The Organic Cotton and Cotton Bamboo options are specifically built to be lightweight and breathable. The bamboo blend especially wicks away moisture so you don't feel sticky.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00053",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[53]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7153,
      "endIndex": 7395,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. What fit should I actually buy?\u000b If you want everyday comfort that isn't too tight or too baggy, go with the Regular Fit. If you have an athletic build and want to show off your arms and chest a bit, the Slim Fit is exactly what you need.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00054",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[54]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7395,
      "endIndex": 7665,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. How is a T-shirt supposed to fit, anyway?\u000b It should lightly hug your chest and shoulders. The shoulder seams need to sit right at the edge of your shoulder bone. Sleeves should hit mid-bicep, and the bottom hem should cover your waistband but stop before your hips.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00055",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[55]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7665,
      "endIndex": 7913,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. How do I make a plain tee look stylish?\u000b It's all about how you pair it. Keep it casual with clean chinos and sneakers, or dress it up by tucking it into a clean pair of pants, wearing a nice belt, and throwing a lightweight linen shirt on top.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00056",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[56]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7913,
      "endIndex": 8131,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "6. Are these made sustainably?\u000bYes. Sustainability isn't just a buzzword for us. We heavily use responsibly sourced Organic Cotton (which uses way less water and no nasty chemicals) and highly renewable Cotton Bamboo.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00057",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[57]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 8131,
      "endIndex": 8370,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "7. Will my 100% cotton T-shirt shrink? \u000bGood quality cotton might shrink a tiny bit after the very first wash, which is normal. But if you wash it in cold water and air-dry it (seriously, skip the dryer), it will hold its shape perfectly.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00058",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[58]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 8370,
      "endIndex": 8613,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "8. Is it okay to wear a polo to the office?\u000b Absolutely. Polos are the backbone of smart-casual workwear. Stick to dark, solid colors like Navy or Black. Iron it well, tuck it into some crisp chinos or structured pants, and you're good to go.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
